{"2945040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shot One Fighters", "steam_appid": 2945040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/fe870101b32749ed091593ae48df1a99.poster.avif?t=1781624413\" width=780 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/fe870101b32749ed091593ae48df1a99.webm?t=1781624413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/fe870101b32749ed091593ae48df1a99.mp4?t=1781624413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>SHOT ONE FIGHTERS is a roguelite 2.5D fighting game. Pick your fighter. Build your moveset and grow more powerful. </i>Every artifact warps the rules. No two runs play the same. The Void is full of cultists, con artists, and allies you didn't expect to find. By the end, you've either built something broken or Paradox has devoured you whole.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/3a1a60d15212cf0b3e3457024628948c.poster.avif?t=1781624413\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/3a1a60d15212cf0b3e3457024628948c.webm?t=1781624413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/3a1a60d15212cf0b3e3457024628948c.mp4?t=1781624413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every move you earn is one you perform. Real inputs, real combo routes. Projectiles, launchers, counters, gap closers. Upgrade what's working or rip it out when something better comes along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/68531bbf3b6b2f876443de1893aa8a76.poster.avif?t=1781624413\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/68531bbf3b6b2f876443de1893aa8a76.webm?t=1781624413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/68531bbf3b6b2f876443de1893aa8a76.mp4?t=1781624413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack the right artifacts and your combos start doing things they shouldn't. Stack the wrong ones and your own build starts working against you. Cursed ones might sabotage your run or you might find a way to weaponize them. Some of the best runs start with the worst luck.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/ced5a4ed6154b285d6de497ab2e5c775.poster.avif?t=1781624413\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/ced5a4ed6154b285d6de497ab2e5c775.webm?t=1781624413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/ced5a4ed6154b285d6de497ab2e5c775.mp4?t=1781624413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your build carried you through the act. The boss doesn't care. These fights are savage, unforgiving, and designed to end your run. Survive one and the rewards are the most powerful moves and artifacts in the game. Die and maybe your next build is the one that breaks through.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/1323189fca6d2cbeac889a7ecf6c82a5.poster.avif?t=1781624413\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/1323189fca6d2cbeac889a7ecf6c82a5.webm?t=1781624413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/1323189fca6d2cbeac889a7ecf6c82a5.mp4?t=1781624413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Volley</strong> broke the seal that kept Paradox contained. Reality cracked. Her best friend Vlad vanished into the Void, and she's tearing through it to find him. Every time the Void kills her, she wakes up in the severed head of a kaiju-sized war mech she calls home. The allies, outcasts, and enemies she drags out of the Void come home with her, and every one of them brings her closer to the truth about what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/66e1daccf97140d1355ca7e510a5f106.avif?t=1781624413\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras_big/66e1daccf97140d1355ca7e510a5f106.webp?t=1781624413 width=1560 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️A single-player roguelite with a cinematic story that unfolds across every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ Six-button fighting game controls that features easy combos! No experience required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥊 100+ moves across multiple characters, each with their own moveset and play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪎 100+ artifacts that will boost your build, break it, or both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 60+ Unique events, mini games, and NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Epic Bosses and Elite encounters across multiple acts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 A mech you call home. You rebuild it. It evolves.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/fe870101b32749ed091593ae48df1a99.poster.avif?t=1781624413\" width=780 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/fe870101b32749ed091593ae48df1a99.webm?t=1781624413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/fe870101b32749ed091593ae48df1a99.mp4?t=1781624413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>SHOT ONE FIGHTERS is a roguelite 2.5D fighting game. Pick your fighter. Build your moveset and grow more powerful. </i>Every artifact warps the rules. No two runs play the same. The Void is full of cultists, con artists, and allies you didn't expect to find. By the end, you've either built something broken or Paradox has devoured you whole.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/3a1a60d15212cf0b3e3457024628948c.poster.avif?t=1781624413\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/3a1a60d15212cf0b3e3457024628948c.webm?t=1781624413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/extras/3a1a60d15212cf0b3e3457024628948c.mp4?t=1781624413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every move you earn is one you perform. Real inputs, real combo routes. Projectiles, launchers, counters, gap closers. Upgrade what's working or rip it out when something better comes a