 across multiple acts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 A mech you call home. You rebuild it. It evolves.</p>", "short_description": "SHOT ONE FIGHTERS is a roguelite 2.5D fighting game. Pick your fighter. Build your moveset and grow more powerful. Discover powerful and cursed artifacts. Fight your way out of a universe Paradox is eating alive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/da25b134c768d69271b0b247ca1b20a6c271d04a/header.jpg?t=1781624413", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/48b5fc16d9473cf342a0755ea7a62484453ebcf4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781624413", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945040/48b5fc16d9473cf342a0755ea7a62484453ebcf4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781624413", "website": "https://www.shotonefighters.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 2600X / i5-8500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RX 5500 XT / GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SteamOS &amp; Proton Supported</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 5600 / i5-11600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon 